* Models ngspice cannot use (cuprite_wire test models, MIT).
.SUBCKT VSUP_DIGITAL IN OUT
+ OPTIONAL: DPWR=$G_DPWR DGND=$G_DGND
R1 IN OUT 1k
.ENDS VSUP_DIGITAL
.SUBCKT VSUP_LOCKED IN OUT
$CDNENCSTART
9f8e7d6c5b4a39281706f5e4d3c2b1a0
$CDNENCFINISH
.ENDS VSUP_LOCKED
.SUBCKT VSUP_MIXED IN OUT
E1 OUT 0 VALUE = { IF(V(IN) > 1, 1, 0) }
B1 OUT2 0 V = uplim(V(IN), 1, 0.1)
.ENDS VSUP_MIXED
* Next to them, one ngspice can use without a compatibility mode, although the others hint at one.
.SUBCKT VSUP_PLAIN IN OUT
R1 IN OUT 1k
.ENDS VSUP_PLAIN
